ct with our mission, and contribute to building a more equitable future. By partnering with us, you\u2019re investing in a proven, uniquely Canadian solution that transforms lives and communities. Together, we can scale impact and open doors to brighter futures for women and gender-diverse people across the country.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-custom-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-a79353b4f9d62a867b5a29a28171a684\">Contact Meredith Lilly, Associate Director, Philanthropy, at&nbsp;<strong>meredith.l@upwithwomen.org<\/strong>&nbsp;to learn more.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-advanced-spacer\" style=\"height:24px\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-getwid-button-group\"><div class=\"wp-block-getwid-button-group__wrapper\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/upwithwomen.org\/support-us\/engagement-opportunities\/\">Collaborate With Us<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/upwithwomen.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/KL1_6300-Jemima-Karine-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-43016\" style=\"aspect-ratio:4\/3;object-fit:cover\"\/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"","protected":false},"author":45,"featured_media":0,"parent":42951,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"template-gutenberg.php","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"_kad_post_transparent":"","_kad_post_title":"","_kad_post_layout":"","_kad_post_sidebar_id":"","_kad_post_content_style":"","_kad_post_vertical_padding":"","_kad_post_feature":"","_kad_post_feature_position":"","_kad_post_header":false,"_kad_post_footer":false,"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-43185","page","type-page"